// 1-20: nothing under you but wire.
id l1-20
name 1-20 STILTS
tagline nothing under you but wire.
bg hall
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main pull neon anchor
mechanics current:27 plank:14 pull:11 anchor:3 yank:1 capacitor:1 neon:5 white:3
new -
portion 2.5 steps up 3 tall and back down (11 wide)
portion 5 a 3-tall plateau 10 wide with a current notch on top
portion 5.6 hop 5 one-way planks over current (heights 11332)
portion 6 capacitor gate 22 tiles away
portion 4.6 jump 3 current notches, 5 wide, 5 apart
portion 6 neon/white stones Wnnn (2 wide, 3 apart) over current
portion 4.4 zip 2 anchors (mid, mid), 7 apart, over current
portion 5.8 hop 3 pull ports (mid, low, mid), 8-7 apart, over current
portion 4.7 hop 2 blocks 3 tall and 2 wide over 3-wide current
portion 6 two pull ports up to the top lane
portion 5.6 hop 5 one-way planks over current (heights 12111)
portion 5.6 drive a rail 12 long, swing a 15 gap (high anchors)
portion 5 a low ceiling 11 long over a current notch
portion 5.8 hop 3 pull ports (high, ceiling, ceiling), 7-8 apart, over current
portion 5 a low ceiling 12 long over a current notch
portion 5.3 hop 4 one-way planks over current (heights 1113)
portion 5.8 hop 3 pull ports (ceiling, ceiling, ceiling), 8-7 apart, over current
portion 6.3 neon/white stones WnWn (2 wide, 4 apart) over current
portion 3 blocks 3 tall: double jump
hardness 5.2
map
